  "description": "CR 701.23a, 701.20a, 701.24a, 111.1, 111.4, 603.6a, 611.2a, 514.2, 702.34a: Call the Mountain Chocobo puts a Mountain card (snow or nonbasic too) from its caster's library into her hand revealed, shuffles, and creates a 2/2 green Bird creature token that gets +1/+0 until end of turn whenever a land its controller controls enters; flashback {5}{R} casts it again from the graveyard and exiles it",
